  "bodyHash": "d612d2857163d3fd",
  "content": "\n\n<h1>Fabric Mail</h1>\n<p>一款简单的服务端模组，赋予玩家向离线玩家发送消息的能力，接收方下次登录时将收到该消息。玩家还可以在发送给其他玩家的邮件中包含物品。</p>\n<h5>本模组仅应安装于服务器端。</h5>\n<h3>玩家指令</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><code>/mail gui</code> 打开可交互的邮件阅读界面。</li>\n<li><code>/mail list</code> 列出玩家的所有邮件。</li>\n<li><code>/mail delete all</code> 清空玩家的邮箱。</li>\n<li><code>/mail send &lt;player&gt; &lt;message&gt;</code> 向指定玩家发送消息。</li>\n<li><code>/mail parcel &lt;player&gt; &lt;message&gt;</code> 向指定玩家发送消息，并附带发送者手持的物品。</li>\n<li><code>/mail outbound</code> 列出所有已发送但仍位于收件人邮箱中的邮件。同时也允许你撤回误发的邮件或找回误发的包裹。</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>以下玩家指令可通过聊天栏点击交互触发，但如果你拥有邮件 ID，也可以手动执行。通常将鼠标悬停在邮件消息上即可查看。</h4>\n<ul>\n<li><code>/mail read &lt;mailID&gt;</code> 阅读指定邮件。</li>\n<li><code>/mail delete &lt;mailID&gt;</code> 从玩家邮箱中删除指定邮件。</li>\n<li><code>/mail revoke &lt;mailID&gt;</code> 撤回你已发送的一封邮件。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>管理员指令</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><code>/mail broadcast all/online/offline &lt;message&gt;</code> 向在线、离线或所有玩家发送指定消息。</li>\n<li><code>/mail airdrop all/online/offline &lt;message&gt;</code> 向在线、离线或所有玩家发送指定消息，并附带发送者手持的物品。</li>\n<li><code>/mailconfig maxSentParcels &lt;0-1024&gt;</code> 设置玩家可拥有的最大发出包裹数量（若有人试图在发出的邮件中存储物品，此选项非常有用）。</li>\n<li><code>/mailconfig logCommandUsage &lt;true/false&gt;</code> 启用或禁用将成功的指令执行记录到服务器控制台。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>权限节点</h3>\n<p>Fabric Mail 使用 <a href=\"https://github.com/lucko/fabric-permissions-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric Permissions API</a> 进行指令权限管理。每个节点均设有回退的原版权限等级，以供未安装权限模组的服务器使用。</p>\n<h4>玩家指令</h4>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>节点</th>\n<th>默认值</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><code>fabricmail.mail.list</code></td>\n<td><code>ALL</code></td>\n<td>列出你收到的邮件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>fabricmail.mail.outbound</code></td>\n<td><code>ALL</code></td>\n<td>列出你发出的（出站）邮件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>fabricmail.mail.read</code></td>\n<td><code>ALL</code></td>\n<td>通过 ID 阅读特定邮件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>fabricmail.mail.gui</code></td>\n<td><code>ALL</code></td>\n<td>打开交互式邮件界面</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>fabricmail.mail.delete</code></td>\n<td><code>ALL</code></td>\n<td>从你的邮箱中删除邮件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>fabricmail.mail.send</code></td>\n<td><code>ALL</code></td>\n<td>向其他玩家发送邮件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>fabricmail.mail.parcel</code></td>\n<td><code>ALL</code></td>\n<td>向其他玩家发送带物品的邮件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>fabricmail.mail.revoke</code></td>\n<td><code>ALL</code></td>\n<td>从收件人邮箱中撤回已发送的邮件</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h4>管理员指令</h4>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>节点</th>\n<th>默认值</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><code>fabricmail.mail.broadcast</code></td>\n<td><code>GAMEMASTERS</code></td>\n<td>向在线/离线/所有玩家广播邮件消息</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>fabricmail.mail.airdrop</code></td>\n<td><code>GAMEMASTERS</code></td>\n<td>向在线/离线/所有玩家空投带物品的邮件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>fabricmail.mail.parcel.bypass_limit</code></td>\n<td><code>GAMEMASTERS</code></td>\n<td>发送包裹时绕过最大出站包裹限制</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h4>配置</h4>\n<p>Fabric Mail 使用 <a href=\"https://github.com/lucko/fabric-permissions-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric Permissions API</a>（通过 BorisLib 捆绑）进行指令权限管理。每个节点均设有回退的原版权限等级，以供未安装权限模组的服务器使用。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>节点</th>\n<th>默认值</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><code>fabricmail.config</code></td>\n<td><code>GAMEMASTERS</code></td>\n<td>列出所有配置项</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>fabricmail.config.&lt;name&gt;.get</code></td>\n<td><code>GAMEMASTERS</code></td>\n<td>读取特定配置项</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>fabricmail.config.&lt;name&gt;.set</code></td>\n<td><code>GAMEMASTERS</code></td>\n<td>修改特定配置项</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h3>试试我的其他模组！</h3>\n<p>均为服务端 Fabric 模组 —— 无需客户端安装。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:center\"></th>\n<th>模组</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n<th>链接</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/9J7sCd3t/e6ce366187de25be0efc7ecc736fc27f05452888_96.webp\" width=\"64\"></td>\n<td><strong>Arcana Novum</strong></td>\n<td>Minecraft 最大的纯服务端全功能魔法模组！添加强力物品、多方块结构和首领！</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/borisshoes/ArcanaNovum/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/GitHub-181717?logo=github&logoColor=white\" alt=\"GitHub\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252farcana-novum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Modrinth-00AF5C?logo=modrinth&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/arcana-novum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/CurseForge-F16436?logo=curseforge&logoColor=white\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/xHHbHfVj/c6c224a3d8068cfb9b054e2a03eb9704906dd8cb_96.webp\" width=\"64\"></td>\n<td><strong>Ancestral Archetypes</strong></td>\n<td>高度可配置的起源风格模组，允许玩家选择一种生物以获得独特能力！</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/borisshoes/AncestralArchetypes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/GitHub-181717?logo=github&logoColor=white\" alt=\"GitHub\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fancestral-archetypes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Modrinth-00AF5C?logo=modrinth&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ancestral-archetypes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/CurseForge-F16436?logo=curseforge&logoColor=white\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/QfXOzeIK/b35cbf33da842f170d0aa562033aaddc2a9ab653_96.webp\" width=\"64\"></td>\n<td><strong>Ender Nexus</strong></td>\n<td>高度可配置的 /home、/spawn、/warp、/tpa 和 /rtp 指令合集，支持独立禁用。</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/borisshoes/EnderNexus/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/GitHub-181717?logo=github&logoColor=white\" alt=\"GitHub\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fender-nexus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Modrinth-00AF5C?logo=modrinth&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ender-nexus-fabric-teleports\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/CurseForge-F16436?logo=curseforge&logoColor=white\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/Z63eULDV/dae01789d609498b8f1637ab31d8fe20b6108020_96.webp\" width=\"64\"></td>\n<td><strong>Fabric Mail</strong></td>\n<td>游戏内虚拟邮箱系统，支持在线与离线玩家间收发包裹和消息。</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/borisshoes/fabric-mail/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/GitHub-181717?logo=github&logoColor=white\" alt=\"GitHub\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ffabric-mail\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Modrinth-00AF5C?logo=modrinth&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-mail\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/CurseForge-F16436?logo=curseforge&logoColor=white\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/u40ARaBc/028062616fc2fb729afdbdc697d60f93ff61a918_96.webp\" width=\"64\"></td>\n<td><strong>Fabric Trade</strong></td>\n<td>添加 /trade 指令，提供安全的玩家间交易界面。</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/borisshoes/fabric-trade/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/GitHub-181717?logo=github&logoColor=white\" alt=\"GitHub\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ffabric-trade\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Modrinth-00AF5C?logo=modrinth&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-trade\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/CurseForge-F16436?logo=curseforge&logoColor=white\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/WdlqG9Gd/a401b9bf08c33d85c907025d6689c657b5168508_96.webp\" width=\"64\"></td>\n<td><strong>Limited AFK</strong></td>\n<td>AFK（挂机）检测与管理，支持为服务器配置踢出阈值。</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/borisshoes/LimitedAFK/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/GitHub-181717?logo=github&logoColor=white\" alt=\"GitHub\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252flimited-afk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Modrinth-00AF5C?logo=modrinth&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/limited-afk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/CurseForge-F16436?logo=curseforge&logoColor=white\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/klpvLefw/97afbda2e56c3f14e04d0f9e0e1fe99db6bd2f27_96.webp\" width=\"64\"></td>\n<td><strong>Links in Chat</strong></td>\n<td>使聊天栏中发布的网址变为可点击状态。</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/borisshoes/fabric-linksinchat/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/GitHub-181717?logo=github&logoColor=white\" alt=\"GitHub\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252flinks-in-chat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Modrinth-00AF5C?logo=modrinth&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/links-in-chat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/CurseForge-F16436?logo=curseforge&logoColor=white\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h3>许可证声明</h3>\n<p>以任何形式使用本项目，即表示您已对本项目的许可条款给予“明确同意”，并确认我（BorisShoes）已履行许可协议下的义务：“在现有情况下已尽合理努力获得接收者对本许可条款的明确同意。”</p>",
